 that it can be out a  little bit longer but man Mary Ann Keene  was a producer on this piece and she  actually got to see it and she said that  to see it up close you don't think  you're gonna get emotional or actually  sense anything like okay I know this is  coming but she said there's just kind of  this quietness when you're in there and  observing it's an actual piece of  history I know it's just it's different  think about anything you see that's  historic and just want to afford that's  still left in terms of the draft so cool  yeah
 

